Section: 7. Conclusion
Text: The audio-text alignment and text-to-text sen- tence alignment was checked to be of high quality in a man- ual evaluation. A cutoff on a sentence alignment quality score allows to ﬁlter the text alignments further, resulting in a clean corpus of 50, 427 German-English sentence pairs aligned to 110 hours of German speech. A larger version of the corpus, comprising 547 hours of German speech and high-quality alignments to German transcriptions is avail- able for speech recognition.

