Section: 6.3. Examples
Text: Longer sentences can in- clude exact matches of longer substrings, however, they are scored based on a bag-of-words overlap (see the ex- amples with scores 0.41 and 0.84 below). This heuristics works well for examples at the low and high end of the range of hunalign scores (scores −0.06 and 0.02 indicate bad alignments, scores higher than 0.75 correspond to rela- tively good alignments).

